{"sections":[{"slug":"Jordan–Holder分解","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Jordan–Holder分解"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Jordan–Holder <span lang=\"zh\">分解</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Jordan–Holder 分解”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">群</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">群</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的合成列是指一列子群</span>\n$$\r\n1=G_0\\hookrightarrow G_1\\hookrightarrow G_2\\hookrightarrow\\cdots\\hookrightarrow G_n=G,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">满足</span> $G_{i-1}\\hookrightarrow G_i$ <span lang=\"zh\">为正规子群</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且商群</span> $G_i/G_{i-1}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为单群</span>.</p>\n<p>Jordan–Holder <span lang=\"zh\">定理指出</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">商群</span> $G_i/G_{i-1}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的序列在相差一个排列的意义下是唯一的</span>.</p>\n"}}}]}